Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='codespacewarm', at=datetime(2026, 10, 13, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title="A Codespace's target stays warm; room is made by age, never by size", body="A Codespace's target STAYS WARM: it is cleared only when no unit in it is read again (a new compiler, dev or test profile, or Rust flags); room is made from the store's unrooted paths, then by age alone, the units no gate read for a week, three days, one (`cargo sweep --time`; never `--maxsize`, whose first fit took the newest set's small units), a cold gate's room (15 GB) when the locks moved since the last gate, and units no gate read for two days go after each gate; the shell the gate runs in is rooted before anything collects; the three crane dependency builds (`suzatary-deps`, `-wasm-deps`, `-core-deps`) are rooted. The wire's TypeScript and the vectors are the flake's core-only builds (the `gate-warm-fast` report).", rationale="Shipped in 1.11.0, 2026-10-13 (the gate-warm-fast report). cargo sweep --maxsize was rejected: its first fit took the newest set's small units.", supersedes=()))